;; expect: main.derive refused derive_shape
;; §8.4 slice 3.19 rule 8: what has no derivation is refused before anything is generated —
;; a type without constructors (the header's), a proposition, Nat (the integer: the
;; elaborator's own rows), an inductive applied to a value, a name that is no type; each
;; with its reason (define_test.sh reads the five records)
(import Init Int.decEq)
(type Void)
(derive Void eq)
(derive True eq)
(derive Nat eq)
(derive (Fin 3) eq)
(derive Nope eq)
